# KitnUI — local-only files. Everything else is tracked; the shipped player zip
# is shaped by .pkgmeta (which strips README/CHANGELOG/.github/etc.), not this
# file. Keep agent config, machine-local tooling, and art masters out of git.

# Claude Code / Codex workspace (config, skills, project instructions)
.claude/
.superpowers/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Machine-local tooling: lint / LS config, editor settings, Blizzard UI symlink
.luacheckrc
.wowluarc.json
.vscode/
.idea/
.wow-api-reference

# Third-party reference addons + their index (local-only by convention)
References/
REFERENCES.md

# CurseForge readme (maintained + published separately from the GitHub README)
README_CF.md

# Art masters — the shipped art is .tga; keep .png/.psd/.xcf sources local
*.png
*.psd
*.xcf

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*.bak
*.tmp
*~
